     <property name="html">
      <string>&lt;p&gt;Estimate EEG spectral power with the Welch method.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Add PSG files and select the EEG channels.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Set the frequency range and analysis windows, or keep the defaults.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Choose a TSV file for the whole-recording report by sleep stage and channel.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;A fixed 0.3–62 Hz band-pass filter is applied. Use channels sampled above 124 Hz (e.g., 125 Hz).&lt;/p&gt;</string>
